Fest <BR>San Leandro California<BR>July (?) 	Pittsburgh Vintage Grand Prix<BR>Pittsburgh Pennsylvania <BR>			Info: <A HREF="http://trfn.clpgh.org/pvgpa/" TARGET=_blank>http://trfn.clpgh.org/pvgpa/</A> <BR>Aug 2-5	FOCOA Festival<BR>Williamsburg Virginia<BR>Aug 18		Fiero Dutch Classic<BR>Denver Pennsylvania<BR>			Info: <A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieropride.com</A> <BR>Sept 9		FieroRama<BR>Oakbrook Illinois<BR> <BR>Sept 22 (not confirmed)<BR>FOCONE Fall Fiero Show<BR>Rutland Massachusetts<BR>			Info: <A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com/rutland.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieropride.com/rutland.htm</A> <BR>Sept 29-30 (not confirmed) <BR>Run For The Hills 6, in North Carolina<BR>			Info: <A HREF="http://fiero.freeyellow.com" TARGET=_blank>http://fiero.freeyellow.com</A> <BR>Oct (?)		MAFOA Fall Fiero Show<BR>Frederick Maryland<BR>			Info: <A HREF="http://members.nbci.com/easternfiero/events.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://members.nbci.com/easternfiero/events.htm</A> <BR>Oct (?)		Atlas All-Pontiac Show<BR>Brandywine Maryland<BR>			Info: <A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com/atlas_pontiac.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieropride.com/atlas_pontiac.htm</A> <BR>Oct (?)		PA Foliage Cruise<BR>Allentown Pennsylvania<BR>			Info: <A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com/pa_cruise.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieropride.com/pa_cruise.htm</A> <BR>Oct (?)		Cruisin’ The Coast<BR>Mississippi Gulf Coast<BR>Info: <A HREF="http://www.cruisinthecoast.com" TARGET=_blank>www.cruisinthecoast.com</A>  <BR>Or: <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/goldcoastfiero/general_information.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/goldcoastfiero/general_information.htm</A> <BR>Oct 26-28 (not confirmed)<BR>Pontiac Oakland Club International Car Show<BR>			Prescott Arizona<BR>Info: fierosman@aol.com (Scott Parker)<BR>Nov 22-25 (not confirmed)<BR>Turkey Rod Run<BR>Daytona Int'l Speedway<BR>Info: <A HREF="http://www.carshows.org/tgeninfo.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.carshows.org/tgeninfo.html<